WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.494
Rovelink helps infrastructure teams govern first and automate second.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.248
Missing customer assignments, ownership, and approval create uncertainty.

00:00:12.248 --> 00:00:17.057
Rovelink makes those gaps visible, connecting documented CMDB reference state

00:00:17.057 --> 00:00:19.462
with observed provider runtime state.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:26.448
NetBox is the reference source. This local demo uses fake Proxmox, Azure, and

00:00:26.448 --> 00:00:30.636
generic providers for runtime inventory. Provider customer hints are

00:00:30.636 --> 00:00:32.962
candidates, never authoritative customer assignments.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:40.479
Use one NetBox Tenant per customer. Rovelink imports that boundary as a

00:00:40.479 --> 00:00:44.711
CustomerScope. Here, the demo virtual machine has an authoritative customer

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:46.827
assignment derived from NetBox Tenant.

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:54.057
Governance blueprints evaluate cached reference objects for customer

00:00:54.057 --> 00:00:58.171
assignment, role, ownership, and readiness metadata. Findings explain what

00:00:58.171 --> 00:01:03.200
needs attention. Governance Ready is a policy result, not permission to

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:03.657
execute.

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:09.181
The Governance Readiness Report summarizes the latest completed evaluations.

00:01:09.181 --> 00:01:14.221
This demo has one ready object and three needing attention. After changing

00:01:14.221 --> 00:01:17.162
NetBox, refresh the cache and evaluate again.

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:24.785
Automation Readiness stays conservative. Ready remains zero when execution

00:01:24.785 --> 00:01:29.170
signals cannot be verified. Inventory eligibility and execution authorization

00:01:29.170 --> 00:01:34.042
are different. A specific automation run still requires GATE checks.

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:39.530
Drift reports reveal differences between reference and runtime. Here, a

00:01:39.530 --> 00:01:44.072
virtual machine is documented as running but observed as stopped. These

00:01:44.072 --> 00:01:48.202
reports are analysis only, with no automatic writeback or remediation.

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:57.213
No automation executed here. Rovelink. Govern first. Automate second.
